        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>That spark of inspiration changes the shape of the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/626c40d3be725398335cd216f751090f.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title, <strong>CYCLIA JOURNEY</strong>, is a 2D puzzle action game set in a geometric world where everything is governed by the “The Law of Replication &amp; Re-creation”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain the keys scattered throughout the map and reach the goal to advance to the next stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/44ca700ef6b26549fbfe235990e69aee.poster.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/44ca700ef6b26549fbfe235990e69aee.webm?t=1783575656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, you'll encounter situations where you can't obtain keys or reach the goal. In such cases, you'll use the power of “replication”—connect and rebuild—to aim for obtaining keys and reaching the goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/2b1953b0ddc42f457d516fe6958008f2.poster.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/2b1953b0ddc42f457d516fe6958008f2.webm?t=1783575656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, the power of replication gains new variations, and you'll use various gimmicks to reach the goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/3eb209f04d22c46ec1505a9f4b720f31.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The theme of this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our vision is to build a unique game where, by immersing themselves in a world built on cycles, players awaken to the hidden patterns that quietly exist in reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty of hidden order lies beneath familiar scenery. A journey full of the joy of discovery awaits you.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>That spark of inspiration changes the shape of the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/626c40d3be725398335cd216f751090f.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title, <strong>CYCLIA JOURNEY</strong>, is a 2D puzzle action game set in a geometric world where everything is governed by the “The Law of Replication &amp; Re-creation”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain the keys scattered throughout the map and reach the goal to advance to the next stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/44ca700ef6b26549fbfe235990e69aee.poster.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/44ca700ef6b26549fbfe235990e69aee.webm?t=1783575656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, you'll encounter situations where you can't obtain keys or reach the goal. In such cases, you'll use the power of “replication”—connect and rebuild—to aim for obtaining keys and reaching the goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/2b1953b0ddc42f457d516fe6958008f2.poster.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/2b1953b0ddc42f457d516fe6958008f2.webm?t=1783575656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, the power of replication gains new variations, and you'll use various gimmicks to reach the goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949920/extras/3eb209f04d22c46ec1505a9f4b720f31.avif?t=1783575656\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The theme of this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our vision is to build a unique game where, by immersing themselves in a world built on cycles, players awaken to the hidden patterns that quietly exist in reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty of hidden order lies beneath familiar scenery. A journey full of the joy of discovery awaits you.</p>",
